{"seq":56,"slug":"bayesian-statistics","title":"贝叶斯统计","stage":"DONE","category":"mathematics-statistics","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/bayesian-statistics","rating":{"composite":4.14,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4.2,"coverage":4,"positioning":4,"strategic":4.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"贝叶斯统计\">贝叶斯统计</h1><h2 id=\"本-hub-是什么\">本 Hub 是什么</h2><p>贝叶斯统计是一种以概率表示不确定性、以观测数据更新信念的统计哲学体系。其核心公式</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>θ</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>D</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>D</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>θ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>D</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P(\\theta|D) = \\frac{P(D|\\theta)\\,P(\\theta)}{P(D)}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.363em;vertical-align:-0.936em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>揭示了三种深刻视角：<strong>信念更新</strong>（先验知识遇上新数据后如何理性修正）、<strong>逆概率</strong>（从结果推原因）与<strong>生成模型</strong>（显式建模数据的产生过程）。</p>\n<p>本 Hub 覆盖贝叶斯统计的完整纵深：从哲学基础与先验设计，到计算推断（MCMC / 变分推断），再到层次模型、贝叶斯回归、模型选择，以及贝叶斯 A/B 测试、贝叶斯优化、贝叶斯深度学习等落地应用。</p>\n<h2 id=\"读者定位\">读者定位</h2><p>面向有一定概率论与编程基础（Python/R）、希望系统掌握贝叶斯思维并落地到实际问题的中级程序员或数据科学家。</p>\n<h2 id=\"内容地图\">内容地图</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>章节</th>\n<th>主题</th>\n<th>文档</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>1. 基础</td>\n<td>哲学、先验、似然</td>\n<td>贝叶斯定理三种解读 · 先验选择 · 似然函数构造</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2. 计算</td>\n<td>MCMC · 变分推断 · 概率编程</td>\n<td>MH/Gibbs/HMC · ELBO/ADVI · Stan/PyMC 生态</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3. 建模</td>\n<td>层次模型 · 贝叶斯回归 · 模型比较</td>\n<td>层次/多层模型 · 稀疏先验 · WAIC/LOO-CV</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>4. 应用</td>\n<td>A/B 测试 · 贝叶斯优化 · 深度学习</td>\n<td>序贯测试 · GP+采集函数 · BNN/MC Dropout</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"与兄弟-hub-的边界\">与兄弟 Hub 的边界</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>兄弟 Hub</th>\n<th>侧重点</th>\n<th>本 Hub 差异</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>probability-statistics</code>（02_）</td>\n<td>频率学派基础：置信区间、假设检验、最大似然</td>\n<td>本 Hub 聚焦贝叶斯哲学框架与后验推断</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>markov-chain-monte-carlo</code>（26_）</td>\n<td>MCMC 算法的数学细节与收敛性理论</td>\n<td>本 Hub 以 MCMC 为计算工具，重在诊断与实用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>stochastic-processes</code>（23_）</td>\n<td>随机过程的数学结构（马尔可夫链、泊松过程）</td>\n<td>本 Hub 将随机过程用于先验建模（高斯过程）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li><code>probability-statistics</code>（02_）：频率学派基础与概率公理</li>\n<li><code>markov-chain-monte-carlo</code>（26_）：MCMC 算法深度剖析</li>\n<li><code>machine-learning-fundamentals</code>（07_）：贝叶斯视角下的机器学习模型</li>\n</ul>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations","title":"贝叶斯基础","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/bayesian-statistics/foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"bayesian-theorem-interpretations","title":"贝叶斯定理三种解读","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/bayesian-statistics/foundations/bayesian-theorem-interpretations"},{"seq":2,"slug":"prior-selection-strategies","title":"先验选择策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/bayesian-statistics/foundations/prior-selection-strategies"},{"seq":3,"slug":"likelihood-function-construction","title":"似然函数构造","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/bayesian-statistics/foundations/likelihood-function-construction"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"computation","title":"贝叶斯计算推断","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/bayesian-statistics/computation","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"mcmc-sampling-diagnostics","title":"MCMC 采样与诊断","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/bayesian-statistics/computation/mcmc-sampling-diagnostics"},{"seq":2,"slug":"variational-inference","title":"变分推断","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/bayesian-statistics/computation/variational-inference"},{"seq":3,"slug":"probabilistic-programming-languages","title":"概率编程语言生态","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/bayesian-statistics/computation/probabilistic-programming-languages"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"modeling","title":"贝叶斯建模","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/bayesian-statistics/modeling","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"hierarchical-models-partial-pooling","title":"层次模型与部分池化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/bayesian-statistics/modeling/hierarchical-models-partial-pooling"},{"seq":2,"slug":"bayesian-regression-sparse-priors","title":"贝叶斯回归与稀疏先验","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/bayesian-statistics/modeling/bayesian-regression-sparse-priors"},{"seq":3,"slug":"model-comparison-selection","title":"模型比较与选择","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/bayesian-statistics/modeling/model-comparison-selection"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"applications","title":"贝叶斯应用实践","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/bayesian-statistics/applications","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"bayesian-ab-testing","title":"贝叶斯 A/B 测试","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/bayesian-statistics/applications/bayesian-ab-testing"},{"seq":2,"slug":"bayesian-optimization","title":"贝叶斯优化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/bayesian-statistics/applications/bayesian-optimization"},{"seq":3,"slug":"bayesian-deep-learning","title":"贝叶斯深度学习","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/bayesian-statistics/applications/bayesian-deep-learning"}]}]}